## 12. Navigation (Expo Router)

### ✅ DO

- Use file-based routing properly
- Implement protected routes with guards
- Use typed navigation (`router.push`, `router.replace`)
- Handle deep linking
- Use layout files for shared UI

### ❌ DON'T

- Navigate to protected routes without auth check
- Use `navigate` when `replace` is more appropriate
- Create duplicate navigation logic

