## Review Checklist

Before approving a PR, verify:

- [ ] No circular dependencies
- [ ] No `any` types without justification
- [ ] All async operations have error handling
- [ ] Loading states are shown for async operations
- [ ] Authentication logic uses service layer
- [ ] Tokens stored securely (not in state)
- [ ] Components are properly typed
- [ ] No unused imports or code
- [ ] Animations use native driver
- [ ] Zustand selectors are optimized
- [ ] API calls are in service layer
- [ ] Error messages are user-friendly
- [ ] Code follows project structure
- [ ] No performance anti-patterns (inline functions in render, missing memoization)
- [ ] Accessibility props are present
- [ ] Safe areas are handled

---

## Priority Levels

**P0 - Critical (Block PR)**

- Security vulnerabilities (tokens in wrong place, exposed secrets)
- Circular dependencies
- Memory leaks
- Broken authentication flows
- App crashes

**P1 - Important (Should Fix)**

- Performance issues (unnecessary re-renders, missing virtualization)
- Missing error handling
- TypeScript errors or extensive use of `any`
- Violating architecture patterns

**P2 - Nice to Have (Suggest)**

- Code style inconsistencies
- Missing comments on complex logic
- Opportunities for refactoring
- Minor performance optimizations

